      "severity": "HIGH",
      "issue": "racecontrol/api/mesh_intelligence.rs pods_mesh_service_key returns 503 only; rc-agent fetch_from_server uses fetch interval 300s, but preserves cache on error. If server restarts with empty/unset TOML and cache is empty on first boot, pods may run without key (potential auth break) for up to first successful fetch window; no explicit 'bootstrap_required' guard observed from the described change."
    },
    {
      "severity": "MEDIUM",
      "issue": "racecontrol/api/mesh_intelligence.rs: condition uses as_deref() then k.is_empty(); whitespace-only (\"   \") passes is_empty and will be served as a key (render_mesh_service_key_body(k)). This reintroduces a 'bad key' failure mode (not covered by provided tests). File: crates/racecontrol/src/api/mesh_intelligence.rs in handler pods_mesh_service_key."
    },
    {
      "severity": "MEDIUM",
      "issue": "rc-agent csv_lap_fallback: change appears log-level only (401/403 => distinct WARN). If deploy monitoring only alerts on ERROR/5xx patterns, auth failures can still be missed; described fix does not add metrics/alerting or escalation logic. File: crates/rc-agent/src/csv_lap_fallback.rs."
    }
  ],
  "recommendation": "DEFER",
  "one_liner": "Fixes reduce silent outages but whitespace/boot-edge cases and log-only auth surfacing remain; challenge deploy until these are proven safe."
}
